  "title": "Win-Win Fusion: Multi-Modal Image Fusion with Visual-Semantic Collaboration",
  "summary": "This work introduces a new visual-semantic mutual reinforcing paradigm for multi-modal image fusion (MMIF) by combining segmentation-guided fusion loss with a multi-modal information interaction mechanism. It aims to overcome the long-standing optimization gap between visual and semantic domains, enhancing both perception capabilities and decision accuracy.",
